      "versionNonce": 220454659,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794525119239,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Strong vs weak certs — do you force future leaders to respect the lock (PBFT,\nTendermint, Raft) or let them override it with a no-decision proof (Simplex)?",
      "fontSize": 19.4961725265526,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Strong vs weak certs — do you force future leaders to respect the lock (PBFT, Tendermint, Raft) or let them override it with a no-decision proof (Simplex)?",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": 1794525119237,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "7tGGFznJpQ-bkMt4qirdy",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 901.0352048126565,
      "y": -162.25167359988188,
      "width": 694.4922436375828,
      "height": 73.11064697457225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#fab005",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b2M",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 546241123,
      "version": 137,
      "versionNonce": 785368749,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1794525119239,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "When do you advance? — on finalization (Tendermint, Raft, PBFT) or on cert\n(Simplex, chained HotStuff)? Advancing on cert gives you pipelining but\nweakens what a cert means.",
      "fontSize": 19.4961725265526,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "When do you advance? — on finalization (Tendermint, Raft, PBFT) or on cert (Simplex, chained HotStuff)? Advancing on cert gives you pipelining but weakens what a cert means.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": 1794525119237,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
